{"final":{"answer":"143.9","value":143.9,"unit":"millions of dollars","result_id":"tool:1","sources":["source:t8c1n0","source:t1c2n0"],"explanation":"From the unrecognized tax benefits reconciliation table, the balance at the beginning of fiscal 2007 (December 29, 2007 column) was $70.5 million and the balance at December 27, 2008 was $214.4 million. The increase observed over 2007 and 2008 is 214.4 − 70.5 = $143.9 million."}}